# The sdist carries the documents a recipient needs to evaluate the
# release without the repository: the changelog (what shipped, per
# cycle) and the contributor/community documents. docs/ and examples/
# stay out deliberately, and the documentation set is large and
# versioned with the repository, not the artifact. The test suite
# ships via setuptools defaults, but it is NOT self-contained: the
# modules that audit the checkout itself are declared, with reasons,
# in tests/CHECKOUT_ONLY, and tools/sdist_scope.py verifies the
# remaining declared scope from the sdist alone (RR-12).
include CHANGELOG.md
include CONTRIBUTING.md
include CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md
# The cycle-231 census test derives from this vendored, SHA-256-pinned
# UnicodeData.txt (15.0.0) and fails closed without it (cycle 234), so
# the data file ships with the test suite it serves.
include tests/data/UnicodeData.txt
# The suite's own scope contracts ship with it: the layer manifest
# the suite is selected by, and the checkout-only manifest that
# declares which shipped modules need the checkout (RR-12).
include tests/test_layers.json
include tests/CHECKOUT_ONLY
